<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 6.</p>
<p>				    June 6/June 5   June 6/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.09		 6.84</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.02		 5.23</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.08		10.01</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -2.40		52.08</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.13		32.01</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.15		32.52</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.33		12.59</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.09		29.54</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.22		39.36</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.13		37.94</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.26		21.37</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -2.34		92.65</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,300,178,223,244</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,939,360,862,322</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,029,064,156,589</p>
<p>  International funds			    95,410,676,529</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    236,342,527,805</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
